  0.3 grants per role, and whether any reach `PUBLIC` (which would make revoking
      from `anon` alone a no-op)
  0.4 what `anon` may write, by name — stage 4's worklist
  0.5 whether `auth.users` holds rows with the SAME uuids as `approved_users`, which
      decides whether stage 1 mints a session for an existing id or has to create
      identities first
